1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Dos clásicos, una fórmula.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
¿Y tu marca?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
Es el viaje del héroe

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,700
de Joseph Campbell:

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,500
la fórmula que nos atrapa.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,300
Uno: tu cliente

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,600
vive con un problema.

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,300
Dos: algo lo empuja

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,600
a querer cambiar.

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,300
Tres: aparece un mentor…

11
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,600
esa es tu marca.

12
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,300
Cuatro: enfrenta el reto

13
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,600
con tu ayuda.

14
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,300
Cinco: regresa transformado…

15
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,600
y lo cuenta.

16
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,618
El error más común:

17
00:00:38,618 --> 00:00:40,735
tu marca como héroe.

18
00:00:40,735 --> 00:00:43,382
El héroe es tu cliente.

19
00:00:43,382 --> 00:00:45,500
Tú eres el mentor.

20
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,500
Nike lo hace:

21
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,700
el atleta es el héroe,

22
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,500
Nike da las herramientas.

23
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,600
Comenta la palabra…

24
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,600
HISTORIA

25
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,400
Síguenos en Atlas Path.
